// SceneProof wire contract (v1).
//
// Two hops share one vocabulary:
//   analyzer (Python, on the device)  --EdgeIngress-->  gateway (Go, on the device)
//   gateway  (Go, on the device)      --Ingest-------->  review server (Python)
//
// Design rules
//   * An Event is a *snapshot* of one zone episode (one track inside one zone).
//     event_id is stable for the episode; `revision` grows on every update
//     (entry -> dwell -> exit). Consumers keep the highest revision and treat
//     (event_id, revision) pairs as idempotent. Because snapshots are complete,
//     a queue may coalesce older revisions into the newest one without loss.
//   * Timestamps: `*_ts` are wall-clock (device clock). `media_*_s` are seconds
//     in the source media (file offset or stream-relative), used to seek video.
//   * Evidence files are referenced by relative path and uploaded separately
//     (UploadEvidence). The Event is accepted before evidence arrives.

